pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.53%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3.6pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_vmar_LiquidRetailersLlcMember_6zzWr0fC4kKLX4APw3whog" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:GoodwillRecognisedAsOfAcquisitionDate" scale="0" id="Tc_oFplNTJ7PEe96lYNTl4_Lw_3_2">190,935</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.82%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Total consideration transferred</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.63%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.53%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3.6pt 0pt 0pt;"> &#8212;</p></td></tr></table></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Goodwill</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Goodwill of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_vmar_LiquidRetailersLlcMember_6zzWr0fC4kKLX4APw3whog" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:GoodwillRecognisedAsOfAcquisitionDate" scale="0" id="Narr_i1pzjLjpVUOgFBGQG_SvrQ">190,935</ix:nonFraction> arising from the acquisition is attributable primarily to expected synergies from the integration of the acquired operations, the assembled workforce, and the strategic benefits of expanding the Company&#8217;s watersports retail platform.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_vmar_LiquidRetailersLlcMember_6zzWr0fC4kKLX4APw3whog" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="ifrs-full:IdentifiableIntangibleAssetsRecognisedAsOfAcquisitionDate" scale="0" id="Narr_PTZL6tCge0Ci3oLUQWPcIA">No</ix:nonFraction> separately identifiable intangible assets were recognized as part of the acquisition.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Contribution to Results</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">From the acquisition date to May 31, 2026, the acquired business contributed revenues of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_vmar_LiquidRetailersLlcMember_tC9FK7FqsUiY94ifkVuLAw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:RevenueOfAcquiree" scale="0" id="Narr_5lVTmYkvbEydMlwVG-uwMg">2,184,556</ix:nonFraction> and a net loss of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_vmar_LiquidRetailersLlcMember_tC9FK7FqsUiY94ifkVuLAw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProfitLossOfAcquiree" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_G6OH6jqRZ06k6yRY8mou9g">338,264</ix:nonFraction> to the Company&#8217;s consolidated results.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Pro Forma Information</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Given the immaterial nature of the acquisition, pro forma revenue and earnings of the combined entity as if the acquisition had occurred at the beginning of the reporting period have not been presented.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfCashAndCashEquivalentsExplanatory" id="Tb_wFs0jlFpy0G8_hi2_ykB5Q" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">5. Cash and cash equivalents</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Cash and cash equivalents exclude amounts that are restricted as to use. As at May 31, 2026, restricted cash of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_DJ_Gbs_XZ0-yoXCWW_X2kQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:RestrictedCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="0" id="Narr_qcA5ryKSgEazUvJ7VTvGAw">400,000</ix:nonFraction> [August 31, 2025 &#8211; <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2025_HfFgBoy0ZEu9yU3FcK5xig" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="ifrs-full:RestrictedCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="0" id="Narr_nsqpE9fG1U6C0YUPHHhpcA">nil</ix:nonFraction>] relates to collateral pledged in support of irrevocable standby letters of credit (&#8220;ILOC&#8221;) <i style="font-style:italic;">[notes 14 and 25]</i>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In accordance with IAS 7, restricted cash is not included in cash and cash equivalents for purposes of the consolidated statement of cash flows. Movements in restricted cash are presented within financing activities.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">5</p></div></div>
