es','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On August 2, 2023, as part of a share subscription, the Company issued warrants with the option to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_8_2_2023_To_8_2_2023_WzaOnxmQhEGAuR-a4cKNiQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_xHWzfXCyYEmorMc4dqwKow">7</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares of the Company for a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_8_2_2023_To_8_2_2023_WzaOnxmQhEGAuR-a4cKNiQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="vmar:IfrsWarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_wHtgygTca0amFfpiKIz2mg">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the grant date at an original exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ggFZRiqKa0a4KEAPuuMx5Q" contextRef="As_Of_8_2_2023_M08Sgoi8dEWGnAXID4blzw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_8Nk9_hGZjUeTB8JyxamHkA">2,187,000.00</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On September 20, 2023, as part of a share subscription, the Company issued warrants with the option to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_20_2023_To_9_20_2023_T9al-nAppkan86duE7L0Uw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_9bet_I0UwEelU9Vt6JYDAw">2</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares of the Company for a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_20_2023_To_9_20_2023_T9al-nAppkan86duE7L0Uw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="vmar:IfrsWarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_B_O8gehhhEq-V01jHhu3Mw">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the grant date at an original exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ggFZRiqKa0a4KEAPuuMx5Q" contextRef="As_Of_9_20_2023_msVHs1iBhkOmjijufJmBCQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_CMffjOfH102VzOnb-0m0og">2,187,000.00</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On December 13, 2023, the Company agreed to reduce the exercise price of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="As_Of_12_13_2023_h6qGw9milku69NQ-JDSDVg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfWarrantsForWhichExercisePriceAgreedToReduce" scale="0" id="Narr_Rc10zY9paEKsnSuZ_w0yLw">12</ix:nonFraction> of its previously issued warrants to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ggFZRiqKa0a4KEAPuuMx5Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_13_2023_h6qGw9milku69NQ-JDSDVg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_p6looHt8C0avwzQn1emHuQ">567,000.00</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On January 14, 2025, as part of a share subscription, the Company issued warrants with the option to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_1_14_2025_To_1_14_2025_ifrs-full_TypesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_vmar_WarrantsIssuedToCommonShareholdersMember_vvz-DAwovE2bojEX1ToTTQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_VtwGN2FdVEqBnsmzelP05g">593</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares of the Company for a period of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_LI22dd6oQkygJFtvCn7_jw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-si