nia Electric Boat Company Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Hurricane Corporate Services Ltd. (prior to March 1, 2024)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Mac Engineering SASU (prior to July 11, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Marine Ventures LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">1925 Holiday Holdings LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">300 US 1 Holdings LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Palm City Marine LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">18</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">Vision Marine Technologies Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to the condensed interim consolidated financial statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">(Unaudited)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">May 31, 2026</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_XOoTn1VxJkOJ6bkBiMebLQ_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_r9WRuKworkm107Hc_D73TQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_NBX4feegg061Q8ODRwKhCg_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_Uj6bTHfElEWDW3lsgea4Tw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_PwwXQDa42U-YazYy-ZGTSw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_Lh66PsEtPEasWNFCnn0YyQ_3_4"></a><a id="Tc__SFxpr0d1kinshytBR4FSg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_75O9MPjla0WqpCC3XQVv8Q_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_6GyK2HCF7EKcHr1U5EFdYw_6_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_Nub9NB6MnkaJ4mV9Tt8A5g_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_Nub9NB6MnkaJ4mV9Tt8A5g_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">NVPB Marina Holdings LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">NV FL 1440 Holdings LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">NV FL Holdings LLC (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Nautical Ventures South Inc. (since June 20, 2025)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Ultimate founder shareholders and their individually controlled entities</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Alexandre Mongeon</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Patrick Bobby</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Robert Ghetti</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">9335-1427 Quebec Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">9519-0682 Quebec Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Immobilier R. Ghetti Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Soci&#233;t&#233; de Placement Robert Ghetti Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Proceeds receivable from related parties</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Under the Real Estate Agreement entered into concurrently with the acquisition of NVG, the Company is entitled to recover value from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_property_w5dpISFGoki_0k3R9Y8Zpg" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcAndOtherRelatedEntitiesMember_OOKr-H69LUuhOme5-fZVZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="vmar:NumberOfRealEstatePropertiesHeld" scale="0" id="Narr_UoCmwwl7zEGiNjy1pYJTgg">six</ix:nonFraction> real estate properties owned by Marine Ventures LLC and other related entities, either through:</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(i)</span></span>receipt of net cash proceeds upon sale to third parties; or</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(ii)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">non-cash settlement through the transfer of the underlying properties to the Company at fair market value, net of outstanding mortgage balances and transaction costs.</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Proceeds receivable from related parties represents the Company&#8217;s contractual right to recover value through either of these settlement mechanisms and, accordingly, is presented as a financial asset rather than as real estate or investment property until settlement occurs.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As at the acquisition date of June 20, 2025, the Company recognized Proceeds receivable from related parties of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_6_20_2025_7VE5mAhC3EenfsVYvDtAPA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_vVue6Vo5ZUW2ZTOl9cf6XA">10,389,917</ix:nonFraction>, representing the fair value of its right to receive such proceeds. As at August 31, 2025, the balance of Proceeds receivable from related parties remained $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2025_HfFgBoy0ZEu9yU3FcK5xig" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_rp9VPvVvZ0aKf47aK3K8Hg">10,389,917</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In October 2025, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_property_w5dpISFGoki_0k3R9Y8Zpg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_ONUyZbGmT0aAC4pIolLG-Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="vmar:NumberOfRealEstatePropertiesHeld" scale="0" id="Narr_qFhFHynpNUiBhuGcJCkQ8A">two</ix:nonFraction> of the six properties were sold by Marine Ventures LLC, resulting in the receipt of net cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_11_30_2025_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_4Y6uu5DkIkS7kEsNqra4xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsFromSaleOfPropertyReceivableFromRelatedPartiesRecognizedAsOfAcquisitionDate" scale="0" id="Narr_5dJ759Xc8UOScbincfpIhA">3,833,603</ix:nonFraction> during the three-month period ended November 30, 2025. Following these transactions, the non-interest-bearing demand note receivable from Marine Ventures LLC was fully settled, and the remaining balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_DJ_Gbs_XZ0-yoXCWW_X2kQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_qleWCDAu9UuZ6VR4z39Aew">6,556,314</ix:nonFraction> represents a contingent receivable related to the remaining properties.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As at May 31, 2026, the fair value of the Proceeds receivable from related parties was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_DJ_Gbs_XZ0-yoXCWW_X2kQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_rOmMBGnM3kSXv5vasydOeQ">6,556,314</ix:nonFraction>, which is disaggregated by expected settlement mechanism as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" name="vmar:ScheduleOfDisaggregationOfProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartiesByExpectedSettlementMechanismTableTextBlock" id="Tb_YC74Dh4qOU6a9waSw7FUZg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:80%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:75.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:75.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;&#160;&#8203;&#160;&#8203;&#160;&#8203;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;&#160;&#8203;&#160;&#8203;&#160;&#8203;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Discounted</b></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:75.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Number&#160;of</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">receivable</b></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:75.86%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Expected settlement mechanism</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">properties</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">$</p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:75.86%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Sale to third party (cash settlement)</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_property_w5dpISFGoki_0k3R9Y8Zpg" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ExpectedSettlementMechanismSaleToThirdPartyCashSettlementMember_xS0hEImvi0KVHD7WkvtUag" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:NumberOfRealEstatePropertiesHeld" scale="0" id="Tc_tA7YIMBbBkWac0ry1nVq0g_4_2">3</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ExpectedSettlementMechanismSaleToThirdPartyCashSettlementMember_xS0hEImvi0KVHD7WkvtUag" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Tc_IhTyblGuQ0qijihhLpCSMA_4_4">5,577,163</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:75.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Transfer to the Company (non-cash settlement)</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_property_w5dpISFGoki_0k3R9Y8Zpg" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ExpectedSettlementMechanismTransferToCompanyNonCashSettlementMember_wCNWlADQ8E66u2Uno8KJFQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:NumberOfRealEstatePropertiesHeld" scale="0" id="Tc_G92Q3dOpIk2T4d7j20US8Q_5_2">1</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ExpectedSettlementMechanismTransferToCompanyNonCashSettlementMember_wCNWlADQ8E66u2Uno8KJFQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Tc_FT4w5nev902_4f37CMzKqQ_5_4">979,151</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:75.86%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Total Proceeds receivable from related party</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.27%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_DJ_Gbs_XZ0-yoXCWW_X2kQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:NumberOfRealEstatePropertiesHeld" scale="0" id="Tc_CEfDNJqWAkuMG9coGv02fA_6_2">4</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.16%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_DJ_Gbs_XZ0-yoXCWW_X2kQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Tc_MYHh3d2Z9UuEhRYprSfFmg_6_4">6,556,314</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;background:#ffff00;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">For properties expected to be sold to third parties, the receivable reflects estimated net cash proceeds based on fair market value, less outstanding mortgage balances, selling commissions and transaction costs, discounted to present value based on the expected timing of sale.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">19</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">Vision Marine Technologies Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to the condensed interim consolidated financial statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">(Unaudited)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">May 31, 2026</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_Nub9NB6MnkaJ4mV9Tt8A5g_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_Nub9NB6MnkaJ4mV9Tt8A5g_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">For properties expected to be transferred to the Company rather than sold to third parties, collectability is achieved through delivery of the underlying real estate assets measured at fair value, rather than through external liquidation. This settlement mechanism does not impair collectability, as the Company ultimately recovers value equivalent to the receivable through acquisition of identifiable real estate assets.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Because the cash flows associated with the Proceeds receivable from related parties are not solely payments of principal and interest, the contingent receivable is measured at fair value through profit or loss in accordance with IFRS 9.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">At May 31, 2026, the fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_DJ_Gbs_XZ0-yoXCWW_X2kQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsReceivableFromRelatedPartyUnderRealEstateAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_xGOjfp7rLU2IMfsmLGMXfw">6,556,314</ix:nonFraction> reflected:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">management&#8217;s estimate of expected net proceeds or fair value of properties to be transferred;</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">the expected timing of settlement, ranging from June 2026 to November 2026;</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">probability-weighted outcomes consistent with market participant assumptions; and</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">discounting of estimated cash flows using credit-adjusted discount rates ranging from approximately </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_xMlTUlsctESFATzoIj6QFg" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember_2nsUW-kZTUCac_VXNOhvSA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:CreditAdjustedDiscountRatesAppliedToCashFlowProjectionProceedsReceivableFromRelatedParties" scale="-2" id="Narr_8TZ5zCY0bUWvAaN7V5KPKw">16.8</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_xMlTUlsctESFATzoIj6QFg" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_TopOfRangeMember_a-Kx6bNpVkyy_tyBustldg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:CreditAdjustedDiscountRatesAppliedToCashFlowProjectionProceedsReceivableFromRelatedParties" scale="-2" id="Narr_DdDEZ_-l3E-fxbYuDyCuZQ">17.8</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Although updated valuation work indicates potential upside relative to the current carrying amount, management has concluded that it would not be appropriate to recognize any increase in the receivable at May 31, 2026 due to the absence of corroborating transactional evidence, such as completed sales or property transfers, as of the reporting date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">A <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_xMlTUlsctESFATzoIj6QFg" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:PercentageOfProbabilityOfRealizationProceedsReceivableFromRelatedParties" scale="-2" id="Narr_Ve6q1Dh9FkaeKuTXX4TxqA">100</ix:nonFraction>% probability was assigned to realization of the Proceeds receivable from related parties based on the valuations and sales processes in place at the acquisition date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Right of use assets and lease liabilities</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company leases <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_xMlTUlsctESFATzoIj6QFg" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_5BCLJiiXG0itU-CQQ2PNLA" decimals="2" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="vmar:NumberOfPropertiesTakenOnLeaseFromRelatedParty" scale="-2" id="Narr_ZRcmLcRqeEO3Kg6b5ejJSg">four</ix:nonFraction> properties from Marine Ventures LLC. These leases are accounted for as right-of-use assets and lease liabilities. As at May 31, 2026, the right-of-use asset for these leases was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_OIZTM5hTWUSrmFe7a32PWg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_S6ScOHLJEEqJM96p_UK0Nw">5,263,826</ix:nonFraction> [August 31, 2025 &#8211; $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2025_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_UtPmORqLpEyGpKyQjEVCzA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_B69HTAFx0069MKsDn_Q3XQ">6,360,457</ix:nonFraction>] and the lease liability was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_OIZTM5hTWUSrmFe7a32PWg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LeaseLiabilities" scale="0" id="Narr_STwpRoa8aEWq9pjiYoU_EA">5,453,428</ix:nonFraction> [August 31, 2025 &#8211; $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2025_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_vmar_MarineVenturesLlcMember_UtPmORqLpEyGpKyQjEVCzA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LeaseLiabilities" scale="0" id="Narr_vVu8SfuRY06M0yRrSYPbQQ">6,290,920</ix:nonFraction>].</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;