er-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3.6pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2025_HfFgBoy0ZEu9yU3FcK5xig" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:IssuedCapital" scale="0" id="Tc_yPGtT-MrpEyurPq_IC-XEQ_7_4">67,144,672</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the nine-month period ended May 31, 2026, the Company issued a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_ckVrlBWb00ew88h8oqYyTQ">2,356</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares to third parties in exchange for marketing, management consulting services, and board fees provided to the Company valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_qQt87ZlWREy2cZwc6W7uzQ">193,168</ix:nonFraction>. For such transactions, the value of the services was paid for with shares, the number of shares being determined by dividing the value of the services provided by the price of the shares on the stock exchange at time of their issuance.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 19, 2025, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_RQ39yiiVnEek56Gmdw33bw">48,126</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_YnEMHLQlBUWIOJRJ-amdDQ">31,875</ix:nonFraction> Pre-Funded Warrants as part of a private placement offering for a total cash consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_tliREmBxqk-izuQ99FVWUw">8,753,801</ix:nonFraction>, net of transaction costs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:TransactionCostNetRelatedToIssuanceOfStock" scale="0" id="Narr_s1lQhjc-dEWjtzpfAS-RYA">842,707</ix:nonFraction>. In addition, the Company issued warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesExchangeOfWarrants" scale="0" id="Narr_ObNUKg3qRESciaYcsij9kw">40,015</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares of the Company for a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="vmar:IfrsWarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_4BHmduCFWUa84HprWLZQAA">five years</ix:nonNumeric> from the issuance date at an exercise price at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ggFZRiqKa0a4KEAPuuMx5Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_ZdXdzXKvsEiwOoD9rsaVfQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_UVG6otJw2U2kPhAwfGyZeg">150.00</ix:nonFraction> which resulted in $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2025_To_12_19_2025_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_vUHjXI0DnkyjAPiuhKK-JQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:InitialRecognitionOfDerivativeLiabilities" scale="0" id="Narr_rAN_1MwkIkWGLKOgIYx-tg">2,867,806</ix:nonFraction> of the cash consideration from this offering to be recognized as derivative liabilities <i style="font-style:italic;">[note 16]</i>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the nine-month period ended May 31, 2026, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_ClassesOfShareCapitalAxis_vmar_PreFundedWarrantsMember_h5WIu-0Z_UCE40e-Vygrlw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfPreFundedWarrantsEquity" scale="0" id="Narr_u5YbMlhjIUC937rTdT_b_w">31,875</ix:nonFraction> Pre-Funded Warrants were converted into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_ClassesOfShareCapitalAxis_vmar_PreFundedWarrantsMember_h5WIu-0Z_UCE40e-Vygrlw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfPreFundedWarrantsEquity" scale="0" id="Narr_7_NiWhSwnku9dq62EyrWsg">31,875</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares at a value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_ClassesOfShareCapitalAxis_vmar_PreFundedWarrantsMember_h5WIu-0Z_UCE40e-Vygrlw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueSharesConversionOfPreFundedWarrantsEquity" scale="0" id="Narr_khLl5TCJZ0ynivygl7KoFQ">3,812,250</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 14, 2026, the Company implemented a reverse stock split, consolidating every <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_1_14_2026_To_1_14_2026_U_ntpmeGp0y-wQ5KhverVg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_Aq6fPp7SMES32E3GVrzIBg">40</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common shares into 1 Voting Common Share. As a result of the round up feature for fractional shares, the Company issued an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_1_14_2026_To_1_14_2026_U_ntpmeGp0y-wQ5KhverVg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesReverseStockSplits" scale="0" id="Narr_SEtfTX69KUWbIO-aSPoEDw">7,121</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the nine-month period ended May 31, 2026, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_AtMarketOfferingMember_GZBy3WljZEC2xC5WP1fhEw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_BckMR3MHAU68I6PMl5YM5g">248,538</ix:nonFraction> Voting Common Shares as part of an &#8220;at the market&#8221; placement offering for a total cash consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2026_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_AtMarketOfferingMember_C_1h-1IIbESsMU9JWhuWQg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:ProceedsFromCapitalRaiseReceivableFromPlacementAgent" scale="0" id="Narr_dVhyAKzgV0SZMNN3m4Y46w">2,928,106</ix:nonFraction>, net of transaction costs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_vmar_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_vmar_AtMarketOfferingMember_GZBy3WljZEC2xC5WP1fhEw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:TransactionCostNetRelatedToIssuanceOfStock" scale="0" id="Narr_qOfV1zoXzkqvjtCozEpGIw">229,551</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">23</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">Vision Marine Technologies Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to the condensed interim consolidated financial statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">(Unaudited)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">May 31, 2026</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_qbIk-6KD4Uaf9iNWsZAh4g_cont1"></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_mejR9zSjd0yixHwTsgknCg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_P0yRrR2oZ06qBK4nHXK2EA_1_6"></a><a id="Tc_t6-hc8ORGUeh4_gBA-fftQ_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_D_7ioOLvlEq5JqQLKWfANQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_uRAIJRw5VESBeT6l13x2Fg_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_F60g09MzCUmv3BV2nIOxww_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_ZgG8WeoDyka5AMrOOIeqLQ_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_TPIIZB4d5UevWnJbEKhVEg_2_10"></a><a id="Tc_y-n8njsfvkqvb5rABQQH4A_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_i3evEBYujEiEEolhyQydMw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_lEYOnq0i8kiPGn-52xuaFQ_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_oazbcSDyPU2bx3SuHeWyQg_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_q4YAY2nTF0y3yM813wYuVQ_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_kyigzR0u50WxzFajiD-cpA_3_10"></a><a id="Tc_r5NDO82ZP0q_LP2RnkzOSQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_vfWKGlOhkUOdmrG5NzQBKA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_gRe4yKu6PkGMKGAtTjv3kA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_ZLYKAWAmk0OTfOuuZc6UWA_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_feQaJvklnEShp_GnFK_6Cg_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_FnGa-2OxbE6WsZX_tCLrHg_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_RwL2crT7u06cu4T1FY9l-Q_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_gXhB7cLIwkGSiL3RxtbKPw_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_-laYdZHBnUC-nK1Ag_5fKQ_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_XxbHCO_XiU6SF0T-4bnP_w_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_SBDSX0ZwK0qCzl49FZdhAw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_mmSfOFoS6kCs6NyrgGFMXw_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_MzNaLMcZvES8yXhWctcDjw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_sYuD2r3ZKUq09e-R_OGK8g_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_dxjvpJ0MoEe_stxbDBgDZA_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_FW7FzAsr8kOB1SOhqjYWUQ_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_MLuasFOEFEmpbpy_QopNJQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_-YvK13G8bUO3t4RhPHHWgA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_Ft-bnOC6AEu1f1agLxAZtQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_tB4DU6MAOUy0wa65uhicCg_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_0h36-gm-hEyQV64qvF8aqA_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_rB7SFgiA4UqkIuZ2_hh8YA_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_gZnjGxTDNkm1oSIhDIS5WA_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_VKnm06FcQki7bJ9bHpF4Fg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_eeNzTPVzA0-q4dsmw5UmbA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_wxhIbQuoD0KfMkAha9AVLQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_rE4DkyOKVEixMIFNgvjRBg_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_cKmaE7_XPkKaMDebg3WiSQ_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_IcvjDBWzEkCBmYAqkbnQAQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_BDL8RAhuZUOrjkjpc9tNvw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_7GxpgpDQLEuqswRaIcmAaw_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_1Az65WIRq0CeENkco-Q-IQ_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_frwcGuDFckKLTLiCQsFKbg_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_NjqUU69PfEW4LtqfFjopcg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_ikZ4KhAyh06SeS4Z_DJTAQ_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_UA2JDlHVYE2IOfEyEyILOg_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_o_YWFFqSuk6cdLkrt77s2Q_4_6"></a><a id="Tc_c8JeMvcghUmCKhRagJnq5A_4_8"></a><a id="Tc_RnU2Sp72pEOHoAM7ce4DqQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_fWh__gqS6EK35JPvilp9VQ_7_0"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementExplanatory" id="Tb_CEvwS7S4REemjTaE4IQMXQ" continuedAt="Tb_CEvwS7S4REemjTaE4IQMXQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">19. Share-based payments</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Stock options</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Description of the plan</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The Company has a fixed option plan. The Company&#8217;s stock option plan is administered by the Board of Directors. Under the plan, the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors may grant stock options to employees, advisors and consultants, and designates the number of options and the share price pursuant to the new options, subject to applicable regulations. The options, when granted, will have an exercise price of no less than the estimated fair value of shares at the date of grant.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On multiple grant dates, the Company granted stock options at exercise prices varying between $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ggFZRiqKa0a4KEAPuuMx5Q" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember_jLq1iWLp8kmioUSnTTrM8w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ExercisePriceShareOptionsGranted2019" scale="0" id="Narr_L-1Y3BkeIEWWZ5dWCv-NaQ">2,644.00</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ggFZRiqKa0a4KEAPuuMx5Q" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_TopOfRangeMember_zBmAO21JLEWf8T5eOArJlA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ExercisePriceShareOptionsGranted2019" scale="0" id="Narr_fcEh35IJlECKaAqPGglAEA">2,435,400.00</ix:nonFraction> per share to directors, officers, employees and consultants of the Company. The stock options will expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember_jLq1iWLp8kmioUSnTTrM8w" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="vmar:ShareOptionsExpirationPeriodFromGrantDate" id="Narr_i063T6wIRUKNNaNbN7dwWQ">5</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_TopOfRangeMember_zBmAO21JLEWf8T5eOArJlA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="vmar:ShareOptionsExpirationPeriodFromGrantDate" id="Narr_uzQ9APH5wUWZVKCZxnJisQ">10&#160;years</ix:nonNumeric> from the grant dates.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Company recognizes share-based payments expense for option grants based on the fair value at the date of grant using the Black-Scholes valuation model. The share-based payments expense recognized for the three-month and nine-month periods ended May 31, 2026 amounts to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_5_31_2026_HRfrjIJ0P0K6ZjEBCcZDuw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsAllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_8qbz_snB7UGWWZ_4rb0fyw">2,765</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsAllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_DvK8YL1LTUCq-0ENZypcCw">15,896</ix:nonFraction> respectively [May 31, 2025 &#8211; $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2025_To_5_31_2025_YzDrR-cm1ESskPmPNnYYWA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vmar:IfrsAllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_-JfUEgKbMEGmVGUcJ-1xZA">8,440</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2024_To_5_31_2025_tPSEQK3