<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">Vision Marine Technologies Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to the condensed interim consolidated financial statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">(Unaudited)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">May 31, 2026</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_Ha4NDmDA106dfLYwLJkoPQ_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_fi1AMTKQ-Eqj9pXEkmV3Aw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_Q5gqkkPEPkG0OwYTd4QNKA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_PFUCiPAJAkqyMi1R_sC4WQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_rWS95lqhOEmMr529rbmVxw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_ltTDEtu6UkKzda2DNR7BHw_1_6"></a><a id="Tc_eDcbzn6sbUuh4zEaMpVy8g_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_Tf9goRUYZU6bsWqCdU8bHQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_P08A6rSLWEek_rQPx10Vfw_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_7uYP2zRoWk-Rar2RVCcjKQ_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_Q4GM4pErrEaPHLqpAn2xqA_2_10"></a><a id="Tc_amzJRxLrN0mxnTNLUIOZxg_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_2AZU_MsHVk-Qj_KmTjrc1w_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_8ulIT3_89keWuyFhaBLm5Q_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_wMgoSJlKZkWqIsRokdGmKg_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_slZKpaSchk64aw9gPufspg_3_10"></a><a id="Tc_7dnqroOVikuiRb2fuNet2Q_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_1FT-rHNsd0yc4ze4ow1XYg_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_v_FMfBcSl0uSFO5GzDIe5g_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_T48YTFMgDk-i_cAhIQCLSA_4_6"></a><a id="Tc_IRAmEMEL7U-UhI7huN7Ygg_4_8"></a><a id="Tc_f9beDXjZJkCeuqf5w6rsrg_4_10"></a><a id="Tc_NfQEFpNKyUyDBGXqyYyIpA_5_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_CEvwS7S4REemjTaE4IQMXQ_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_CEvwS7S4REemjTaE4IQMXQ_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Restricted share unit (&#8220;RSU&#8221;) plan</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Description of the plan</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On September 17, 2025, the Company adopted a RSU Plan pursuant to which restricted share units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;) may be granted to directors, officers, employees and consultants of the Company and its affiliates. Each RSU represents the right to receive one common share of the Company, issued from treasury, or, in limited circumstances, a cash equivalent, upon vesting. RSUs do not confer voting rights or dividend rights prior to vesting. The RSU Plan is administered by the Board of Directors, which determines the eligible participants, the number of RSUs granted, and the applicable vesting conditions. The maximum number of common shares issuable under the RSU Plan, together with other security-based compensation arrangements, is subject to shareholder and regulatory approval and prescribed plan limits.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.33;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On September 25, 2025, the Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_25_2025_To_9_25_2025_NNdw1RHl9kOGVPP6DJ_0Yw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfInstrumentsOtherEquityInstrumentsGranted" scale="0" id="Narr_dDMj_5mUlEasFU8i_Sd9oA">1,250</ix:nonFraction> RSUs to its Chief Executive Officer pursuant to an individual RSU agreement entered into under the RSU Plan. The RSUs vest upon the achievement and maintenance of specified market-capitalization thresholds, measured based on the Company&#8217;s public market capitalization at the close of trading over ten consecutive trading days, as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" name="vmar:ScheduleOfNumberOfRsusVestingBasedOnCompanyPublicMarketCapitalizationThresholdTableTextBlock" id="Tb_SXJJiovi-EyAqNhCOsBSLw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:80%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.48%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:27.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.48%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Market capitalization threshold</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;&#160;&#8203;&#160;&#8203;&#160;&#8203;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:27.91%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Number&#160;of&#160;RSUs&#160;vesting</b></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.48%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">$15 million or more</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.59%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:27.91%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ScenarioMarketCapitalizationThreshold15MillionOrMoreMember_Y8GksHmUck-WCRECDeTQng" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfOtherEquityInstrumentsExercisedOrVestedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" scale="0" id="Tc_RJe3tRP-_0m2QyYTuBnHCw_2_2">375</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.48%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">$25 million or more</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:27.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ScenarioMarketCapitalizationThreshold25MillionOrMoreMember_MpOxj-Z-pke-4Mw5R64xIA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfOtherEquityInstrumentsExercisedOrVestedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" scale="0" id="Tc_JrqNMxBCO0uBVOIyWX8EsA_3_2">375</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.48%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">$35 million or more</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.59%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:27.91%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PSKhk4L0BEuBjbMNWXfihw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_vmar_ScenarioMarketCapitalizationThreshold35MillionOrMoreMember_JiGaOWWyeEOpNnsyx1xeew" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfOtherEquityInstrumentsExercisedOrVestedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" scale="0" id="Tc_DisAV9M1hkury7lJ1T_Rgg_4_2">500</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Unvested RSUs generally forfeit upon termination for cause or voluntary resignation without good reason. In the event of termination without cause, resignation with good reason, death or disability, unvested RSUs remain outstanding and eligible to vest in accordance with their original terms. All unvested RSUs vest immediately upon a change of control of the Company.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The RSUs are accounted for as equity-settled share-based payment arrangements in accordance with IFRS 2, as the Company&#8217;s primary obligation is to settle the awards through the issuance of common shares. Although the RSU Plan and related agreements permit settlement in cash in limited circumstances (including regulatory or plan-limit constraints), such features are contingent and do not give rise to a present obligation for cash settlement at the grant date. The RSUs were measured at fair value at the grant date based on the market price of the Company&#8217;s common shares on that date. The vesting conditions are market-based performance conditions and, accordingly, are reflected in the grant-date fair value of the awards. Compensation expense is recognized over the requisite service period and is not subsequently reversed as a result of the failure to satisfy market-based vesting conditions. Given the presence of market-based vesting conditions, management determined that a Monte Carlo simulation model was the appropriate valuation technique, as it explicitly incorporates the probability of achieving the market-cap hurdles. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The share-based compensation expense recognized for the three-month and nine-month periods ended May 31, 2026 amounts to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_vmar_RestrictedShareUnitPlanMember_YVkLIqqEfE2ATbb6vZ5now" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ExpenseFromSharebasedPaymentTransactionsWithEmployees" scale="0" id="Narr_mLvHj_4TWEmgUqv4hQofYg">18,270</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_vmar_RestrictedShareUnitPlanMember_uOW84qptokWaFAKeKg030Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ExpenseFromSharebasedPaymentTransactionsWithEmployees" scale="0" id="Narr__WUATriIpE-Q5_e7gzXKyw">49,250</ix:nonFraction> respectively [May 31, 2025 &#8211; <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_8tOzrXACyEyiIY7tlUEziA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2024_To_5_31_2025_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_vmar_RestrictedShareUnitPlanMember_Gt31-1yif0aUfeYEBH95ZQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="ifrs-full:ExpenseFromSharebasedPaymentTransactionsWithEmployees" scale="0" id="Narr_VZQcFNR1YU-DlXNDmVVT8Q">nil</ix:nonFraction> for both periods]. The table below lists the assumptions used to determine the fair value of these RSUs. Volatility is based on the historical share price volatility of the Company and other public companies with characteristics similar to the Company.</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_5_31_2026_HTBmuVpRt0andh7knIPPbQ" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfIndirectMeasurementOfFairValueOfGoodsOrServicesReceivedOtherEquityInstrumentsGrantedDuringPeriodExplanatory" id="Tb_r85eVMY07EujSxwL_nJm7g" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:59.92%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:6.23%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bott